{"step_index":349,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:57:54Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-30T09:57:54+09:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: d0ec53e0-5d72-4d0e-894d-f2b58c54bcfd/task-349\nTask Description: & \"C:\\Users\\lg\\.local\\bin\\python3.11.exe\" -c \"\nimport openpyxl, os, sys\nfrom copy import copy\nfrom openpyxl.styles.colors import Color\nsys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding='utf-8')\n\ntarget_p = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.xlsx'\nbackup_p = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명__BACKUP_20260921_090440.xlsx'\ntemp_p = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명_TEMP.xlsx'\n\nprint('Loading workbooks...')\nwb_t = openpyxl.load_workbook(target_p)\nwb_b = openpyxl.load_workbook(backup_p, data_only=True)\n\nws_t = wb_t['기업체 리스트']\nws_b = wb_b['기업체 리스트']\nheaders = [ws_t.cell(1, c).value for c in range(1, ws_t.max_column+1)]\n\nRED_COLOR = Color(rgb='FFFF0000')\n\nupdated_cells = []\n\nfor r in range(2, 2315):\n    for c in range(1, ws_t.max_column+1):\n        cell_t = ws_t.cell(r, c)\n        vt = cell_t.value\n        vb = ws_b.cell(r, c).value\n        st = str(vt).strip() if vt is not None else ''\n        sb = str(vb).strip() if vb is not None else ''\n        if st != sb and st != '':\n            is_red = False\n            if cell_t.font and cell_t.font.color and str(cell_t.font.color.rgb) in ['FFFF0000', 'FFFF3300', 'FFED0000']:\n                is_red = True\n            if not is_red:\n                # Update font color to red\n                if cell_t.font:\n                    new_font = copy(cell_t.font)\n                    new_font.color = RED_COLOR\n                    cell_t.font = new_font\n                else:\n                    cell_t.font = openpyxl.styles.Font(name='맑은 고딕', size=10, color=RED_COLOR)\n                \n                company = ws_t.cell(r, 3).value\n                updated_cells.append((r, company, c, headers[c-1], vb, vt))\n\nprint(f'Total cells updated to RED font: {len(updated_cells)}')\n\nprint('Saving to TEMP file...')\nwb_t.save(temp_p)\nwb_t.close()\nwb_b.close()\nprint('TEMP file successfully saved! Size:', os.path.getsize(temp_p))\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/d0ec53e0-5d72-4d0e-894d-f2b58c54bcfd/.system_generated/tasks/task-349.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
